# `M240` `A` (`D1309`) — an action-only file that SORTS FIRST. It holds no test, so every door's
# landing rule has to look past it; a page that landed on `files[0]` landed here, on nothing, which
# is what the review measured on the dogfood's own `_auth.tflw` (U1). The action is a real one and
# `tests/hooks/hook-first.tflw` calls it, so this is not a decoy the runner would skip.

action readShelf(id)
  api GET /items/{id}
  expect status equals 200
  capture body.name as shelfName
  give shelfName
